{title: I have decided to follow Jesus –}
{subtitle: Hymnal 382}

{comment: Chorus}
I have decided to follow Jesus,
I have decided to follow Jesus
I have decided to follow Jesus,
No turning back, no turning back

{comment: Verse 1}
Tho none go with me, I still will follow,
Tho none go with me, I still will follow
Tho none go with me, I still will follow,
No turning back, no turning back

{comment: Verse 2}
Will you decide now to follow Jesus,
Will you decide now to follow Jesus
Will you decide now to follow Jesus,
No turning back, no turning back
